{"id": "2016104", "name": "עבור אילו ערכי הפרמטר הטור מתכנס (a*n^2/b*n^2)^n", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>יהא \\(a\\) פרמטר ממשי. עבור אילו ערכי \\(a\\) מתקיים כי הטור הבא מתכנס:</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\left(\\frac{a\\cdot n^{2}+{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}+{{CT:0}}}\\right)^n}\\)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><p>את התשובה יש להזין כביטוי לוגי כדוגמת הביטוי הבא</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\[ a&gt;= -7\\mbox{ and } a&lt;5\\]</p><p>תוך שימוש בסימנים</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">.\\[ \\text{&lt;, &lt;=, &gt;, &gt;=, =, and, or} \\]</p><p></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["b", "tans"], "nvariants": 50}